// Example Hyper mapping usage:
//  HYPER(1): Ctrl+Shift+Alt+GUI+1
//  HYPER(2): Ctrl+Shift+Alt+GUI+2
//  HYPER(Q): Ctrl+Shift+Alt+GUI+Q
// For other keys, use as HYPER(<KEYCODE>)

